<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">&#8220;<U>Permitted Deductions</U>&#8221; means the sum, without duplication, of the following costs or expenses: </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">(a) any documented Ampreloxetine Royalty Payments (as defined in the RP Agreement) actually paid by Parent or any of its
