more amendments hereto for the purpose of adding, eliminating or changing any provisions of this Agreement, even if such addition, elimination or change is materially adverse to the interest of the Holders; <U>provided</U>, <U>however</U>, that no
such amendment shall, without the consent of the Holders of not less than <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">sixty-six</FONT> percent (66%) of the outstanding CVRs: </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:13%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">(i) modify in a manner adverse to the Holders (A)&nbsp;any provision contained herein with respect to the
termination of this Agreement or the CVRs, (B)&nbsp;the time for, or amount of, any payment to be made to the Holders pursuant to this Agreement, or (C)&nbsp;the definition of CVR License Proceeds, CVR Product, CVR Product License, First Commercial
