<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="justify">Section&nbsp;6.4 <U>Benefits of Agreement</U>. Nothing in this Agreement, express or implied, will give to any Person (other
